    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "《特拉特洛尔科条约》是一项旨在实现中南美洲无核化的条约。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 84,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "条约禁止核武器的试验、使用、制造、生产、取得、储存和部署。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 87,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_OMITS_DEPLOYMENT"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "看来，由苏联在古巴部署核武器所引发的一连串危机，正是促成条约签订的契机。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 108,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_OMITS_TREATY_CAUSATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "也是。那13天里，全世界都因核战争可能爆发的恐惧而冻结。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 80,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "不过到目前为止，最关键的古巴还没有加入。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 60,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_RATIFICATION_SPECIFICITY_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "话虽如此，这项条约已经有20多个国家批准。要是公然践踏，必然会遭到国际社会谴责。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 116,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_OMITS_INTERNATIONAL_CONDEMNATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "是啊。<R=拉丁美洲禁止核武器组织,OPANAL>也会介入调查吧。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=拉丁美洲禁止核武器组织,OPANAL>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 77,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "听说制定这项条约时，参考了日本“无核三原则”的概念。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 78,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "不过，《特拉特洛尔科条约》还要求拥核国家「不得对成员国使用核武器」。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 102,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_PARAPHRASE_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "这正是它与无核三原则大不相同的地方。也就是说，它还有第4项原则。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 94,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_OMITS_FOURTH_PRINCIPLE"
    }
  ]
}
